{"version":"Notebook/1.0","items":[{"type":1,"content":{"json":"## MDE Custom Data Collection - Validation and Training

Every comparison is scoped to the devices that actually have custom collection turned on, so it is a fair before and after and is not skewed by environment size. **Top half** of each tab is the default `Device*Events` table on those devices. **Bottom half** is the `DeviceCustom*Events` table. Some tables like Image Load, Script, and Registry stream far more events under custom. Others like Process, Network, and File already have broad default coverage and the win is a scoped, complete feed tagged with RuleName, not extra columns. Every custom table has the same schema as its default table plus RuleName. Script is the one exception, it also adds ScriptContent and ScriptContentSHA256.

Pick your **Workspace** at the top (it defaults to the workspace you opened this workbook from), then use the **Time Range** and **Device** selectors and walk the tabs: Overview, Process, Network, File, Registry, Image Load, Script."},"name":"title"},{"type":9,"content":{"version":"KqlParameterItem/1.0","parameters":[{"id":"p-workspace-0000","version":"KqlParameterItem/1.0","name":"Workspace","label":"Workspace","type":5,"isRequired":true,"multiSelect":false,"quote":"'","resourceType":"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces","crossComponentResources":["value::all"],"typeSettings":{"additionalResourceOptions":[],"showDefault":false}},{"id":"p-timerange-0001","version":"KqlParameterItem/1.0","name":"TimeRange","label":"Time Range","type":4,"isRequired":true,"typeSettings":{"selectableValues":[{"durationMs":3600000},{"durationMs":14400000},{"durationMs":86400000},{"durationMs":604800000},{"durationMs":2592000000}],"allowCustom":true},"value":{"durationMs":86400000}},{"id":"p-device-0002","version":"KqlParameterItem/1.0","name":"DeviceName","label":"Device (type a full or partial name, or leave All Devices for everything)","type":1,"isRequired":true,"value":"All Devices"}],"style":"pills","queryType":0,"resourceType":"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"},"name":"global-parameters"},{"type":11,"content":{"version":"LinkItem/1.0","style":"tabs","links":[{"id":"tab-ov","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Overview","subTarget":"Overview","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-pr","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Process","subTarget":"Process","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-nw","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Network","subTarget":"Network","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-fl","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"File","subTarget":"File","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-rg","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Registry","subTarget":"Registry","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-il","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Image Load","subTarget":"ImageLoad","style":"button"},{"id":"tab-sc","cellValue":"Tab","linkTarget":"parameter","linkLabel":"Script","subTarget":"Script","style":"button"}]},"name":"tabs"},{"type":12,"content":{"version":"NotebookGroup/1.0","groupType":"editable","items":[{"type":1,"content":{"json":"### Overview - the case for custom data collection

The bars and grid below compare event volume per table on the devices that have custom collection on, default versus custom, so both sides are the same device scope and not skewed by environment size. Where custom is higher, the default table was only seeing part of the activity. Where default is higher, you already had broad coverage and the custom win is a scoped, complete feed of the chosen action type tagged with RuleName, not extra columns. Registry stays at zero on both sides until a Registry rule is enabled on a device.

**How a rule works (read this first):** each custom rule picks exactly **one action type** (required single select), so each `DeviceCustom*Events` table streams only the action its rule was built with. Rule **conditions** are AND filters that trim volume, not add fields. To capture a different action type you build a **separate rule**. Every rule is capped at **75,000 events per device per 24h** rolling window. Each tab lists the full action type catalog the wizard offers versus the one your rule streams today."},"name":"ov-header"},{"type":3,"content":{"version":"KqlItem/1.0","query":"let cd = union isfuzzy=true (DeviceCustomProcessEvents),(DeviceCustomNetworkEvents),(DeviceCustomFileEvents),(DeviceCustomRegistryEvents),(DeviceCustomImageLoadEvents),(DeviceCustomScriptEvents)
| where Timestamp {TimeRange}
| distinct DeviceName;
let d = union isfuzzy=true (DeviceProcessEvents|extend T='Process'),(DeviceNetworkEvents|extend T='Network'),(DeviceFileEvents|extend T='File'),(DeviceRegistryEvents|extend T='Registry'),(DeviceImageLoadEvents|extend T='Image Load'),(DeviceEvents | where ActionType has_any ('ScriptContent','PowerShellCommand','AmsiScriptContent','ScriptExecution') | extend T='Script')
| where Timestamp {TimeRange}
| where DeviceName in (cd)
| where '{DeviceName}' in ('All Devices','*') or isempty('{DeviceName}') or DeviceName contains '{DeviceName}'
| summarize Events=count() by Table=T, Source='1 Without Custom';
let c = union isfuzzy=true (DeviceCustomProcessEvents|extend T='Process'),(DeviceCustomNetworkEvents|extend T='Network'),(DeviceCustomFileEvents|extend T='File'),(DeviceCustomRegistryEvents|extend T='Registry'),(DeviceCustomImageLoadEvents|extend T='Image Load'),(DeviceCustomScriptEvents|extend T='Script')
| where Timestamp {TimeRange}
| where '{DeviceName}' in ('All Devices','*') or isempty('{DeviceName}') or DeviceName contains '{DeviceName}'
| summarize Events=count() by Table=T, Source='2 With Custom';
union d, c | order by Table asc","size":0,"title":"Event volume by table - default vs custom (devices with custom on)","timeContextFromParameter":"TimeRange","queryType":0,"resourceType":"microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces","visualization":"barchart","chartSettings":{"xAxis":"Table","yAxis":["Events"],"group":"Source","seriesLabelSettings":[{"seriesName":"1 Without Custom","color":"gray"},{"seriesName":"2 With Custom","color":"green"}]}},"customWidth":"100","name":"ov-bar"},{"type":3,"content":{"version":"KqlItem/1.0","query":"let cd = union isfuzzy=true (DeviceCustomProcessEvents),(DeviceCustomNetworkEvents),(DeviceCustomFileEvents),(DeviceCustomRegistryEvents),(DeviceCustomImageLoadEvents),(DeviceCustomScriptEvents)
